   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As of January 2016, Sida and FBA are responsible for implementing the Swedish development cooperation with Liberia, from 2016 to 2020. FBA&apos;s efforts within the framework of the strategy&apos;s focus area safeguarded human security and freedom from violence is</narrative>
